{"name": "Dreadful Defenders", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find Relics with eldritch abilities. Summon dreadful Defenders with unique traits, control the path by placing them, and combine their Benedictions to create otherworldly synergies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SUMMON DEFENDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offer souls to your God to pick a Defender among three, each with a random Benediction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"314\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/a0fb96012918e323479207287ccdb295.poster.avif?t=1785431842\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/a0fb96012918e323479207287ccdb295.webm?t=1785431842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/a0fb96012918e323479207287ccdb295.mp4?t=1785431842\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHAPE THE PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The path grows by one tile every wave, and Defenders you place influence its direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/f208feb14d4b3d0a82081b1cb69c202c.webp?t=1785431842\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/f208feb14d4b3d0a82081b1cb69c202c.poster.avif?t=1785431842\" width=\"609\"/></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UPGRADE DEFENDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sacrifice a Defender to transfer one of its Benediction to the upgraded one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"314\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/56affa2f3d17c1780e6643a5adb8be69.poster.avif?t=1785431842\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/56affa2f3d17c1780e6643a5adb8be69.webm?t=1785431842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/56affa2f3d17c1780e6643a5adb8be69.mp4?t=1785431842\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>COLLECT RELICS OF OLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat Elite Enemies to reclaim Relics crafted by the old gods.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CREATE UNCANNY SYNERGIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine Defenders, Benedictions and Relics to create unstoppable eldritch monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"174\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/1fa3d6c0a4e15955b5bdfd44dff1e503.poster.avif?t=1785431842\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/1fa3d6c0a4e15955b5bdfd44dff1e503.webm?t=1785431842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/extras/1fa3d6c0a4e15955b5bdfd44dff1e503.mp4?t=1785431842\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHALLENGE EVOLVING BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map has a unique boss that will grow stronger every time you face them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Find Relics with eldritch abilities. Summon dreadful Defenders with unique traits, control the path by placing them, and combine their Benedictions to create otherworldly synergies!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363550/28609467d3a4983cc2c765a73034089d329fd7c7/header.jpg?t=1785431842", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Tower Defense", "Roguelite", "Strategy", "Procedural Generation", "Singleplayer", "Roguelike"], "developers": "Erelag Studio", "publishers": "Erelag Studio", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3363550", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "7 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ieACdKVl7Ak", "first_seen": 1786053600.0, "review_rank": 143}